out.push(A('_Three sentences, each naming its criterion:_ **"On the inversion: all three questions are clean and the third one is the hardest shape in the unit — _which of the two … is the correct one_ — and you have it right. On the exits left for the reader: there are two, and the stronger is "our photocopier rather than your pen", which I am going to use. On the ranking: the reason you give is the right kind of reason, but I would say what you will do if the third answer does not come by the eleventh, because at present the date has nothing behind it."**'));
